        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia TRADDB, Traditional Single Cylinder Round Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia made auxiliary deadbolt lock is the perfect compliment to traditional homes. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy</b></a> collections Traditional Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 7 finishes. It is available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets with 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia TRADDB Traditional Round Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: 5 pin, Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced door frame strike with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>1\" Throw deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-deadbolt-install.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Deadbolt Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia TRADDB Traditional Round Auxiliary Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Omnia TRADDB",
                "description": "Single Cylinder Traditional Deadbolt, Omnia TRADDB - This Omnia made auxiliary deadbolt is the perfect compliment to traditional homes. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. It is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets with 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses. The Traditional Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 7 finishes.",
                "keywords": "Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Omnia TRADDB Traditional Single Cylinder Round Deadbolt locks, OMN-TRADDB Traditional deadbolts, Omnia Prodigy Collections, Round Auxiliary Deadbolts, Single Cylinder Round Deadbolts, Traditional Round Single Cylinder Deadbolts, omnia locks, omnia deadbolts,"
